# RumiNZuni

Pakistan kids wear store. Cash on delivery only (no Stripe unless explicitly requested).

- Next.js 15 + Payload CMS 3 + TypeScript + Tailwind. Admin is `/admin`.
- Read `AGENTS.md` for stack, folders, commands, and COD/order rules.
- Never commit `.env`. Verify prices and stock on the server in checkout.
- PKR + Pakistani mobile numbers. Reuse `src/lib/pakistan.ts`.
